1:["$","main",null,{"className":"site-main page-dev-subsystems","id":"main","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"page-heading","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"mycmux 開発者向け"}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"周辺の仕組み"}],"$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"dev-nav","aria-label":"開発者向けページの中の移動","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"dev-nav-root","href":"/dev","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"開発者向け"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","/dev/boundary",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/boundary","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"境界"}]}],["$","li","/dev/editor",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/editor","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"エディタ本体"}]}],["$","li","/dev/observation",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/observation","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"観測とカード"}]}],["$","li","/dev/dispatch",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/dispatch","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"ディスパッチ"}]}],["$","li","/dev/resume",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/resume","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"resume"}]}],["$","li","/dev/house",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/house","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"エージェントの家"}]}],["$","li","/dev/subsystems",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/subsystems","aria-current":"page","children":"周辺の仕組み"}]}],["$","li","/dev/runtime",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/runtime","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"いま動いているもの"}]}],["$","li","/dev/plans",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/plans","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"設計文書と実装"}]}],["$","li","/dev/responsibility",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/responsibility","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"立ち位置と約束"}]}],["$","li","/dev/glossary",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/glossary","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"用語"}]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"intro","children":[["$","div","0",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<div class=\"callout accent\"><p>エディタの中核の外にある仕組みは、ほとんどが調査当日も動いていました。AI ログ、使用量、アカウント切替、履歴、ポケット、セーブポイント、ランチャーの候補、ペインの整理、ペットです。</p><p>アプリが LLM を呼ぶ経路は 2 つしかありません。CLI（<code>codex exec</code> か <code>claude -p</code>）を子プロセスとして起動する経路と、Jev を OpenRouter の API で呼ぶ経路です。</p><p>アカウント切替は、エージェント製品の認証ファイル（<code>~/.claude/.credentials.json</code>、<code>~/.codex/auth.json</code>、<code>~/.grok/auth.json</code>）を書き換えます。history.db（2.88GB）は書き込まれるだけで、読む経路がどこにもありません。</p></div>\n<p>ターミナルと委譲の外にある機能を、1 つずつ見ていきます。8 月に AI ログ、使用量、アカウント切替が入り、9 月には Jev による再配置と、ポケット mycmux への一本化が入りました。作者の運用（~/.claude にある skill、hook、スクリプト、台帳）にも、似た役目のものがあります。日報、statusline、要約で、重なりもあわせて書きます。</p>"}}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"reading-layout","children":[["$","$Le",null,{"sections":[{"id":"list","title":"一覧"},{"id":"ailog","title":"AI ログ（ailog）"},{"id":"usage","title":"使用量とアカウント切替"},{"id":"history","title":"履歴 history.db"},{"id":"pocket","title":"ポケット mycmux"},{"id":"savepoint","title":"セーブポイント"},{"id":"launcher-dirs","title":"ランチャーの候補（launcher_dirs）"},{"id":"tidy","title":"ペインの整理（自動命名、ペイン整理、ペイン再配置）"},{"id":"llm-calls","title":"アプリが LLM を呼ぶ箇所（全件）"},{"id":"pet","title":"ペット、壁紙、テーマ"},{"id":"mail","title":"メール監視"},{"id":"misc","title":"diag、e2e、その他"},{"id":"overlaps","title":"作者の運用やエージェント製品との重なり（21 件）"},{"id":"unverified","title":"未確認事項"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"reading-article","children":[["$","details",null,{"className":"mobile-contents","children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"このページの目次"}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"このページの目次","children":["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","list",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#list","children":"一覧"}]}],["$","li","ailog",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#ailog","children":"AI ログ（ailog）"}]}],["$","li","usage",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#usage","children":"使用量とアカウント切替"}]}],["$","li","history",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#history","children":"履歴 history.db"}]}],["$","li","pocket",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#pocket","children":"ポケット mycmux"}]}],["$","li","savepoint",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#savepoint","children":"セーブポイント"}]}],["$","li","launcher-dirs",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#launcher-dirs","children":"ランチャーの候補（launcher_dirs）"}]}],["$","li","tidy",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#tidy","children":"ペインの整理（自動命名、ペイン整理、ペイン再配置）"}]}],["$","li","llm-calls",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#llm-calls","children":"アプリが LLM を呼ぶ箇所（全件）"}]}],["$","li","pet",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#pet","children":"ペット、壁紙、テーマ"}]}],["$","li","mail",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#mail","children":"メール監視"}]}],["$","li","misc",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#misc","children":"diag、e2e、その他"}]}],["$","li","overlaps",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#overlaps","children":"作者の運用やエージェント製品との重なり（21 件）"}]}],"$Lf"]}]}]]}],"$L10","$L11","$L12"]}]]}]]}]
